preCMType/Defn.lean
-------------------
Line numbers as of 2026-10-26. No sorries left: preCMType and
preCMType.ofComplexStructure are done.

[ ] Natural map from a preCMType to the infinite places of F
      φ ↦ InfinitePlace.mk φ should be a bijection Φ ≃ InfinitePlace F,
      giving card Φ = nrComplexPlaces F = finrank ℚ F / 2
      (NumberField.Embeddings.card, IsTotallyComplex.finrank).

[ ] Lemma: the partition condition for all embeddings σ : F →+* ℂ, not
      just the w.embedding (comment at the end of the file, with proof idea).

[ ] Consider stating partition_condition as
      IsCompl partition ((conj).comp '' partition) (comment at the end of
      the file lists IsCompl and Mathlib's other partition notions).

[ ] Docstrings: field `partition` ("inclusions" → "embeddings"; it is a
      subset, not a partition); `partition_condition` ("infact"; it is
      about an embedding and its conjugate, not an infinite place; the
      partition is partition ⊔ conj ∘ partition, not partition ⊔
      partitionᶜ). Missing docstrings on preCMType and
      ofComplexStructure; module docstring says "section".

[ ] Naming: preCMType → PreCMType (UpperCamelCase), maybe just CMType;
      maybe rename the field `partition` (e.g. carrier / embeddings).
      [NumberField F] [IsCMField F] are included in the structure only
      via the `variable` line; it only needs [Field F].


